{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-yaheetech-recliner-armchair-2511-0290","content_id":"a0068feb-1661-4cf7-89aa-1def8214ecd9","description":"Product Recall for Yaheetech Recliner Armchair presenting a serious risk of fire. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"ee1ecaee-9bb7-4ea7-bc40-1c27bfbcaa01","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-11-28T12:18:48+00:00","id":"ee1ecaee-9bb7-4ea7-bc40-1c27bfbcaa01","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-11-28T12:18:48+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69299328ce50d215cae961e3/2511-0290-product-recall-yaheetech-recliner-armchair-black.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Yaheetech Recliner Armchair</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product does not meet fire safety requirements. This means there is a potential risk of a fire if the product is exposed to an ignition source.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Furniture - Household/Office Chairs/Stools (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Yaheetech</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>610887 – Black</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batch</td>\n      <td>202507 and 202508</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASIN</td>\n      <td>B0BDKX966B</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Fabric-upholstered recliner in black, with padded seat, backrest, armrests and manual reclining function.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_ee1ecaee-9bb7-4ea7-bc40-1c27bfbcaa01\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69299328ce50d215cae961e3/2511-0290-product-recall-yaheetech-recliner-armchair-black.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product does not meet fire safety requirements. This means there is a potential risk of a fire if the product is exposed to an ignition source. </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Furniture and Furnishings (Fire) (Safety) Regulations 1988.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users. </p>\n\n<p>Owners are advised to contact Monumart Ltd to arrange for the return of the product for disposal and a full refund. Monumart Ltd can be contacted at 01473 747 903 or customerservice@yaheetechuk.com.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0290</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-28T13:35:44Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"furniture","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-11-28","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-11-28T13:35:44+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-yaheetech-recliner-armchair-2511-0290","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/